{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And they charged Joseph.</b> Why did they not charge him during their father's lifetime? They said: What do we have to stir up the hatred, for it has already been forgotten and passed. Once they returned from burying their father and Joseph passed by the pit into which his brothers had thrown him, he said: Blessed be He who performed a miracle for me in this place. They said: There is still hatred hidden in his heart. Immediately: ויצוו אל יוסף."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:32.595340665Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}